          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अनुशोचति (anuśocati) is built on anu, \"after\", and the root √śuc, \"to grieve\", which also gives śoka, \"grief\"; MW gives anuśuc as to mourn over, to regret (MW)."
            }
          ]
